host_about:
Live and work in Stockholm with my girlfriend. Originally from Denmark and strangely enough I love the Swedish winter and take any chance available to go cross country skiing. In summer it's sailing in the archipelagos and bicycling.

My girlfriend and I have enjoyed staying on Airbnb abroad and we hope you will enjoy living in our cozy little flat in Stockholm. Of course we will give you insider tips on what to see and do in the neighbourhood and around Stockholm. 

//Kasper
